  "dek": "A 68.91 score puts Tufa ahead of Yi-Chia Chen; NVARC3 moves past the last dance in a reshuffled leading group.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition\n\nTufa retakes the ARC-AGI-3 lead: its recorded score rises to 68.91, ahead of Yi-Chia Chen at 67.49. NVARC3 advances to fourth at 43.94, just above the last dance. ARC Slayers holds eighth; its October 12 breakthrough is not another overnight gain.\n\nFull report: https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-13-morning-arc-3",
